xuanmo-ws:p005:m0025"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws-5-199","title":"徐州刺史","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"bdx_txf_e62_AA","attestations":[{"id":"th-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws-5-199:a","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005","start":199,"end":203,"surface":"徐州刺史","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0025","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-076","chapter_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws","source_id":"s-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws-ws1997726","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005","quote":"元凶弒立，玄謨為冀州刺史。孝武伐逆，玄謨遣濟南太守垣護之將兵赴義。事平，除徐州刺史，加都督。及南郡王義宣與江州刺史臧質反，朝庭假玄謨輔國將軍，拜豫州刺史，與柳元景南討，軍屯梁山，夾岸築偃月壘，水陸待之。義宣遣劉諶之就臧質，陳軍城南，玄謨留老弱守城，悉精兵接戰，賊遂大潰。加都督、前將軍，封曲江縣侯。中軍司馬劉沖之白孝武，言：「玄謨在梁山，與義宣通謀。」上意不能明，使有司奏玄謨多取寶貨，虛張戰簿，與徐州刺史垣護之並免官。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0025"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-050-xuanmo-yuanhuzhi:p001","text":"垣護之字彥宗，略陽桓道人也。祖敞，仕苻氏，為長樂國郎中令。慕容德入青州，以敞為車騎長史。德兄子超襲偽位，伯父遵、父苗復見委任。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":42,"last_line":42,"raw_start":3283,"raw_end":3346,"raw_character_offsets":[3283,3284,3285,3286,3287,3288,3289,3290,3291,3292,3293,3294,3295,3296,3297,3298,3299,3300,3301,3302,3303,3304,3305,3306,3307,3308,3309,3310,3311,3312,3313,3314,3315,3316,3317,3318,3319,3320,3321,3322,3323,3324,33